  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Proteccin Social Responsiva a Choques en El Salvador</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shock Responsive Social Protection in El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del Programa es incrementar la resiliencia de los hogares afectados por eventos adversos, incluyendo aquellos causados por Cambio Climtico (CC), a travs de la creacin de un sistema integrado de proteccin social responsivo a choques, la entrega de Transferencias Monetarias (TM) temporales y el fortalecimiento de la oferta de Desarrollo Infantil Temprano (DIT) para dichos hogares.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Program is to increase the resilience of households affected by adverse events, including those caused by Climate Change (CC), through the creation of an integrated system of social protection responsive to shocks, the provision of temporary Cash Transfers (CT) and the strengthening of the Early Childhood Development (ECD) offer for said households.</narrative>
  </description>
